recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the runner stands green and rostered, and the one seam left is a lap rather than a question: glow_desk_reach_scan.sh reads covered from the elder witness alone, so two instruments now answer differently about one population. That union is one if over --list plus two pen behaviors, and it wants its own round.
